# Project specific
# Documentation is part of the codebase and is versioned. Everything else that
# lands in docs/ (generated coverage reports, exported dumps, scratch notes)
# stays ignored — hence ignore-the-directory-then-un-ignore-the-Markdown rather
# than dropping the rule entirely.
docs/*
!docs/*.md